    <link>https://longbatian.site/%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93/%E7%B4%A0%E9%A3%9F%E7%A7%91%E6%8A%80/%E5%B9%B2%E7%85%B8%E5%9B%9B%E5%AD%A3%E8%B1%86%EF%BC%88%E6%B8%85%E6%B7%A1%EF%BC%89</link>
    <guid>https://longbatian.site/%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93/%E7%B4%A0%E9%A3%9F%E7%A7%91%E6%8A%80/%E5%B9%B2%E7%85%B8%E5%9B%9B%E5%AD%A3%E8%B1%86%EF%BC%88%E6%B8%85%E6%B7%A1%EF%BC%89</guid>
    <description><![CDATA[ 四季豆煸到干瘪，只放盐和少许味精，不加重口调料，突出豆角本身的清甜。 ]]></description>
    <pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
  </item><item>
    <title>木耳炒莴笋</title>
    <link>https://longbatian.site/%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93/%E7%B4%A0%E9%A3%9F%E7%A7%91%E6%8A%80/%E6%9C%A8%E8%80%B3%E7%82%92%E8%8E%B4%E7%AC%8B</link>
    <guid>https://longbatian.site/%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93/%E7%B4%A0%E9%A3%9F%E7%A7%91%E6%8A%80/%E6%9C%A8%E8%80%B3%E7%82%92%E8%8E%B4%E7%AC%8B</guid>
    <description><![CDATA[ 木耳焯水、莴笋片大火快炒，加水焖一分钟调味，最后水淀粉勾芡挂汁。 ]]></description>
    <pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 16:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
  </item><item>
    <title>炝炒土豆丝</title>
    <link>https://longbatian.site/%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93/%E7%B4%A0%E9%A3%9F%E7%A7%91%E6%8A%80/%E7%82%9D%E7%82%92%E5%9C%9F%E8%B1%86%E4%B8%9D</link>
